        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/a7f4461f58e7802366758a8d3335d25c.avif?t=1780311406\" width=1200 height=295 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/46093371e19cc650c1f056e7e35b4583.webp?t=1780311406\" width=600 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan, Aim, Shoot! FLICK SHOT ROGUES is a super-satisfying roguelike dungeon crawler about lining up the perfect shot to send your hero spinning across the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/79bfb29f07b651df508a3572360c7f7f.poster.avif?t=1780311406\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/79bfb29f07b651df508a3572360c7f7f.webm?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/79bfb29f07b651df508a3572360c7f7f.mp4?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/b36992dcd053f6dc7cf95d298fb4ac99.webp?t=1780311406\" width=600 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger wickedly explosive combos and blast the battlefield apart, but don’t be hasty – a misfire could spell your doom!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/344da11686d3e5dfa27cbd439d26c609.poster.avif?t=1780311406\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/344da11686d3e5dfa27cbd439d26c609.webm?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/344da11686d3e5dfa27cbd439d26c609.mp4?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/0f6518ffa8a90ec465a67c7cf1afa1e0.webp?t=1780311406\" width=600 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end! Each new journey across the island will reshuffle the enemies and offer different rewards. Rise to the challenge and adapt your strategy accordingly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/0770fe822bb18ad49e7fe440e105b733.poster.avif?t=1780311406\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/0770fe822bb18ad49e7fe440e105b733.webm?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/0770fe822bb18ad49e7fe440e105b733.mp4?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/b43f5a9957184cfab043023377d6bbc1.webp?t=1780311406\" width=600 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful items, talents, and curses, each with unique and game-changing effects. Brave the risks of the curse and supercharge your run with game breaking interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/71aecb0d8cf5eaed64cb5b86c4037f84.poster.avif?t=1780311406\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/71aecb0d8cf5eaed64cb5b86c4037f84.webm?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/71aecb0d8cf5eaed64cb5b86c4037f84.mp4?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/a7f4461f58e7802366758a8d3335d25c.avif?t=1780311406\" width=1200 height=295 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/46093371e19cc650c1f056e7e35b4583.webp?t=1780311406\" width=600 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan, Aim, Shoot! FLICK SHOT ROGUES is a super-satisfying roguelike dungeon crawler about lining up the perfect shot to send your hero spinning across the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/79bfb29f07b651df508a3572360c7f7f.poster.avif?t=1780311406\" width=900 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/79bfb29f07b651df508a3572360c7f7f.webm?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/79bfb29f07b651df508a3572360c7f7f.mp4?t=1780311406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427450/extras/b36992dcd053f6dc7cf95d298fb4ac99.webp?t=1780311406\" width=600 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger wickedly explosive combos and blast the battlefield apart, but don’t be hasty – a misfire could spell your doom!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l